# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Ignore all files then explicitly whitelist ones we want.
#
# The binary is built on the host (see scripts/build.sh), so the image build
# needs nothing from the source tree beyond the binaries and the CA bundle.
*
# Binaries built by `make image-binaries`, one per target platform
!bin/ngrok-operator-*
# CA certificates baked into the image
!certs/*
!**/*.go
!**/*.mod
!**/*.sum
